SUMMARY:Serendipity (2001)
LOCATION:Moreland Theater\, 6712 SE Milwaukie Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.4752;-122.6504
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Peter Chelsom · 90 min\n\nAlthough already in relationshi
 ps\, two strangers realize they have genuine chemistry after a chance enco
 unter – but part company soon after. Years later\, they each yearn to re
 unite\, despite being destined for the altar. But to give true love a chan
 ce\, they have to find one another again.\n\nTickets: https://morelandthea
 ter.com/tickets/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-sc
 reens-pdx/
URL:https://morelandtheater.com/tickets/
END:VEVENT
